# Commit messages

Use [Angular commit convention](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#commit). Write the entire message in English.

```
<type>(<scope>): <subject>

<body>

<footer>
```

- Header is required. Scope is optional.
- Subject: imperative present tense (`add` not `added` / `adds`), no leading capital, no trailing period.
- Body: why, not what; wrap at 100 characters.
- Footer: `BREAKING CHANGE:` and issue references (`Closes #123`).
- No `Co-Authored-By`, `Signed-off-by`, "Generated with" / "Made with", model or agent names, or other trailers.

Types: `feat` `fix` `docs` `style` `refactor` `perf` `test` `build` `ci`

```
feat(module): add static module registry
fix(string): reject empty views in find
build(cmake): map RelWithDebInfo to Conan Release
refactor: lowercase source directories
```

```
添加模块注册
Fix String bug.
feat(module): Add Static Registry.
```
